# API Test Cases (HTTP Format)

**Note**: Use with REST clients like VS Code REST Client extension, Postman, or curl.

## Variables
```
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.task.id}}
```

---

## Authentication Tests

### Register New User
```http
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

Expected: 201 Created with user object and tokens

---

### Login
```http
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}
```

Expected: 200 OK with user object and tokens

---

### Login with Invalid Credentials
```http
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}
```

Expected: 401 Unauthorized

---

## Task Tests

### Create Task
```http
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "description": "Buy groceries"
}
```

Expected: 201 Created with task object

---

### Create Task with Empty Description
```http
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "description": ""
}
```

Expected: 400 Bad Request with validation error

---

### List All Tasks
```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
```

Expected: 200 OK with tasks array

---

### List Incomplete Tasks Only
```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?completed=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
```

Expected: 200 OK with incomplete tasks only

---

### Update Task Description
```http
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "description": "Buy groceries and milk",
  "updatedAt": "2026-01-05T10:00:00.000Z"
}
```

Expected: 200 OK with updated task

---

### Complete Task
```http
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "isComplete": true,
  "updatedAt": "2026-01-05T10:00:00.000Z"
}
```

Expected: 200 OK with completedAt timestamp set

---

### Delete Task
```http
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
```

Expected: 204 No Content

---

### Access Task Without Auth
```http
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
```

Expected: 401 Unauthorized

---

## Edge Cases

### Create Task Exceeding Character Limit
```http
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "description": "{{ 501 character string }}"
}
```

Expected: 400 Bad Request

---

### Update Non-Existent Task
```http
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/invalid_id_999
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
```

Expected: 404 Not Found
